OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits smuggling Albanians on
OL,4,AChannel yacht
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who sailed with 17 passengers on
OL,7,Fa yacht from France has pleaded guilty
OL,8,Fto facilitating illegal immigration to
OL,9,Fthe UK.
OL,11,FThe vessel was bound for the coast near
OL,12,FPortland, Dorset, on 27 August, the
OL,13,FNational Crime Agency (NCA) said.
OL,15,FOn board were 16 Albanian men and one
OL,16,Fboy, who were dealt with by immigration
OL,17,Fauthorities, the agency added.
OL,19,FIt said Eno Gajda, a 58-year-old
OL,20,FAlbanian fisherman, would be sentenced
OL,21,Fat Bournemouth Crown Court on 18
OL,22,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
